 "notes": "Ground atmosphere (openspec change ground-forces-rework, tasks 6.1/6.2; design plan/ground-atmosphere.md). Every layer is procedural: seeded periodic noise on the texel grid, quantised to stepped alpha (4 levels plus transparent; the one family exempt from binary alpha). Tiled bands wrap seamlessly at 512 texels. Per-sector fog tints are sampled from each sector painting's horizon band (as the flyover sky bake places it), blended with the plan's starting tint and clamped to luma 0.10-0.22 (Rec. 709 on sRGB) and chroma (max-min) <= 0.12. No GPU job: the optional SDXL low-cloud strips (strip-sheet.json) were not run; procedural is the plan's default. Every value here is an input to tools/ground_atmosphere (go run . pack), which writes the atlas, lib/game/ground_atmosphere_atlas.dart and ground-atmosphere-runs.json.",
